Section: The sizers

 FOUR MORE SHAPES, ONE PER RESIZE DIRECTION, IN THE SAME 16 BY 24 BOX. Sharing
 the arrow's box is what keeps the save-under buffer the size it always was:
 its row stride is 16 words and 2048 bytes holds 16 by 31, so nothing about the
 `cs` block changes to admit these.

 THE MASKS BELOW WERE GENERATED, NOT TYPED. The fill of each shape is defined
 by a rule -- two heads and a shaft for the straight pair, two corner triangles
 and a diagonal shaft for the other -- and the edge is the 8-neighbour outline
 of that fill. Hand-authoring 96 bitmasks against printed art is how art and
 mask drift apart while both look right; deriving one from the other means a
 wrong number would have to be wrong in the picture too. The vertical arrow is
 the horizontal one TRANSPOSED for the same reason, so the pair cannot disagree
 about weight or length.

 THEIR HOTSPOT IS THE CENTRE AND THE ARROW'S IS ITS TIP. A sizer that pointed
 from its top-left corner would sit a diagonal away from the edge it claims to
 grab, and the hit zone it selects would not be the zone under the point.

  cursor-shape-arrow : Integer = 0
  cursor-shape-ew : Integer = 1
  cursor-shape-ns : Integer = 2
  cursor-shape-nwse : Integer = 3
  cursor-shape-nesw : Integer = 4

  cursor-hot-x : Integer -> Integer
  cursor-hot-x (shape) = if shape == cursor-shape-arrow then 0 else 8

  cursor-hot-y : Integer -> Integer
  cursor-hot-y (shape) = if shape == cursor-shape-arrow then 0 else 12

   EW, the left and right edges
   r08  ..EEE......EEE..
   r09  .EEFE......EFEE.
   r10  EEFFEEEEEEEEFFEE
   r11  EFFFFFFFFFFFFFFE
   r12  FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
   r13  EFFFFFFFFFFFFFFE
   r14  EEFFEEEEEEEEFFEE
   r15  .EEFE......EFEE.
   r16  ..EEE......EEE..

  cursor-edge-ew : Integer -> Integer
  cursor-edge-ew (r) =
    if r == 8 then 14364
    else if r == 9 then 26646
    else if r == 10 then 53235
    else if r == 11 then 32769
    else if r == 13 then 32769
    else if r == 14 then 53235
    else if r == 15 then 26646
    else if r == 16 then 14364
    else 0

  cursor-fill-ew : Integer -> Integer
  cursor-fill-ew (r) =
    if r == 9 then 4104
    else if r == 10 then 12300
    else if r == 11 then 32766
    else if r == 12 then 65535
    else if r == 13 then 32766
    else if r == 14 then 12300
    else if r == 15 then 4104
